  "contentHtml": "<p>학생들과 작년에 활동했던 활동지입니다. 제과만 등에서 활동지를 얻어 개인적으로 편집해 사용했습니다.</p><p>많이 부족하지만 선생님들의 수업에 조금이나 도움이 되셨으면 합니다.</p><p>활동지와 예시(학생들이 직접 작성)로 나뉘어져 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/727fa8d083ef66845336fa9e824d0d6578913a4c?download\" data-file-name=\"(수행) 항상성 유지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"49152\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D553%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240508104516&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F727fa8d083ef66845336fa9e824d0d6578913a4c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(수행) 항상성 유지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">48.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e6abb45608c0827d09c480bab42c9a78df65485?download\" data-file-name=\"(수행) 항상성 유지(예시).pdf\" data-file-size=\"688039\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D553%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20240508104516&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F5e6abb45608c0827d09c480bab42c9a78df65485')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(수행) 항상성 유지(예시)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">671.91KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/944d99948e7c832335a3674500a3ab0941317860?download\" data-file-name=\"과학 3학년 2학기 활동지(체세포분열).hwp\" data-file-size=\"38912\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D553%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20240508104516&url=https%3A%2F%2F